CREATE TABLE t_issue_internal_738(
    pram_tp_nm        TEXT,
    proc_nm           TEXT,
    isp_gr_key_id     TEXT,
    isp_atc_nm        TEXT,
    lang_id           TEXT,
    proc_id           TEXT
);
NOTICE:  Table doesn't have 'DISTRIBUTED BY' clause -- Using column named 'pram_tp_nm' as the Apache Cloudberry data distribution key for this table.
HINT:  The 'DISTRIBUTED BY' clause determines the distribution of data. Make sure column(s) chosen are the optimal data distribution key to minimize skew.
